<title>FINLAND: FINNISH NOV PRIVATE CAR SALES UP 15 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>FINNISH NOV PRIVATE CAR SALES UP 15 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registrations in Finland of new private cars increased 15 percent year-on-year in November to 6,039 cars, the Information Centre of the Automobile Branch said in a statement on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The centre gave the following figures:</p>
<p>								Jan-Nov change</p>
<p>		     Nov '96    1-11'96    1-11'95    yr/yr pct</p>
<p>    Private cars   6,039     91,711     76,519	+19.9</p>
<p>    Vans		 783	8,165	6,101	+33.8</p>
<p>    Lorries	    347	3,261	2,920	+11.7</p>
<p>    Buses		 42	  419	  282	+48.6</p>
<p>    Total	    7,211    103,556     85,822	+20.7</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
</text>
